{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_111_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_111_fc_01_title", "source_sha256": "52b8843e54d343035648fd9f907e6fa6057f780c67f2cd0d7c926b7e3ebbe012", "ja": "水着と海とアイドルと", "zh": "泳装、大海与偶像", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_111_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_111_fc_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "8662dd9020b2cca000e3f71098e0a3a4d7a1d16a55167dc31e3f2af3e041f703", "ja": "やってきました、沖縄！\nロケ地のビーチで、\nたくさん笑ってたくさん遊ぶ、\nアイドルたちの一幕です。", "zh": "我们来到冲绳啦！\n在拍摄地点的海滩上，\n偶像们尽情欢笑、尽情玩耍，\n这是其中的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_111_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_111_fc_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8e83c44b42af045ff3d5c0cb9f03cc3a462885eb21e6ac879a2cfbfd2c583064", "ja": "（明日のPV撮影のため、ビーチにやってきた。\nそろそろリハの時間だが、探検にいった環達は……）", "zh": "（为了明天的PV拍摄来到了海滩。差不多该排练了，可是去探险的环她们……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_111_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_111_fc_01_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "4ccc11a9071afb4ad6460747a25cc4ef9a4539d778618c3e05589e1c3d318ed1", "ja": "あーっ、おやぶんはっけ～ん！\nうみみ、いたぞー！　こっちこっちー！", "zh": "啊——发现老大啦～！\n海美美，找到了——！这边这边——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_111_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_111_fc_01_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "c36c3a043498e26393794d9cf3545a57714b3a264781de5eb5836224a71afa98", "ja": "ごめーーーん！　おまたせ、{$P$}！\n遅くなっちゃったけど……まだ時間大丈夫？", "zh": "对不起——让你久等了，{$P$}！\n虽然来晚了……现在还来得及吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_111_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_111_fc_01_1003_p", "source_sha256": "01d8b3a04dd343bc609261f9c7982aaf7fcef8b4fe478c507d1c6f46fd3cd31e", "ja": "良かった。ふたりとも戻って来たな。\n時間は問題ないけど、いったいどこに行ってたんだ？", "zh": "太好了。你们两个都回来了啊。时间没问题，不过你们到底去哪儿了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_111_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_111_fc_01_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "4805544344474f34d4d375db88939e2991d005a2009b7441e38cb9ea5b41c40a", "ja": "えっとね、海辺をかるーくダッシュしたり、\n砂浜で体操したり……ね、環？", "zh": "那个嘛，我们在海边稍微跑了跑步，还在沙滩上做了做体操……对吧，环？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_111_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_111_fc_01_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "82352421e69a0639874ea6cca69ab917d07c96e1c9738fa6dcae572514d6032e", "ja": "うん！　うみみにね、体を柔らかくする方法を\nいーっぱい教えてもらったんだぞ！", "zh": "嗯！海美教了我好多让身体变柔软的方法呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_111_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_111_fc_01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "732ba8f3f8b22a3b48dfb4f2d23df329c9140f4bcad6176fb9271f0da5a0b529", "ja": "おお、よかったな、環！\nさて、ふたりも戻ってきたし、他のみんなも……", "zh": "哦，那太好了，环！\n好了，既然你们两个也回来了，其他人也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_111_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_111_fc_01_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "072ecdfa6ad71976d079ade68c1b5bdd108787a6ddb55376abec760836c55cf7", "ja": "あっ！　海美ちゃんと環ちゃん、おかえりなさ～い♪\n着替え、待たせちゃってごめんなさ～い。", "zh": "啊！海美和环，欢迎回来～♪\n换衣服让你们久等啦，不好意思～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_111_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_111_fc_01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "15094c5bdaa24d4da2c96a101c188361a15a3615714579114f3cd74b57d15e81", "ja": "お、来たか。いや、ナイスタイミングだよ。\nふたりとも、ちょうど今戻ってきたところだし。", "zh": "哦，来了吗。不，来得正是时候。\n你们两个也正好刚回来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_111_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_111_fc_01_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0cfd9169ef39b05b27fa80dd18a3c38992c8cbb8be8816d2bdf7e67b808934a1", "ja": "着替えるなり、飛び出してっちゃうんだもんな～。\n早すぎてビックリしたよ。", "zh": "一换好衣服就飞奔出去了嘛～  \n快得让人吓了一跳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_111_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_111_fc_01_1010_008tak", "source_sha256": "cf426ca469a2294ce13d0a57e8b6e465eada9e78dbcc5958806e79c376ba1049", "ja": "それだけ海が楽しみだったということでしょう。\n心躍る気持ち、わかる気もします。", "zh": "看来她是那么期待大海吧。\n这种心潮澎湃的感觉，我似乎也能理解。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_111_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_111_fc_01_1011_042miy", "source_sha256": "8429b4c83a5bb23bb8f72e8619f94e624037cb3176dc81fbb0e6a9e52c7bcb2c", "ja": "こちらに着いてから、ずーっとそわそわして\nいましたからね～。一足先の海はどうでしたか～？", "zh": "到这里之后，就一直坐立不安的呢～。提前去看海感觉怎么样呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_111_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_111_fc_01_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "58ef840807130d9aec1a562edc956b1bba93246fc515b6ecef91acc959272d2d", "ja": "すっごい楽しかった！\nたまきたち、サメと一緒にダッシュもしてきたぞー！", "zh": "超级开心！\n环和大家还跟鲨鱼一起冲刺了哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_111_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_111_fc_01_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b96c4c78852a825927891f359e38e83e5eaa788fa218568e75d843b8afa17bf7", "ja": "さ、サメ～～っ！？", "zh": "鲨、鲨鱼～～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_111_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_111_fc_01_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "b96c4c78852a825927891f359e38e83e5eaa788fa218568e75d843b8afa17bf7", "ja": "さ、サメ～～っ！？", "zh": "鲨、鲨鱼～～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_111_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_111_fc_01_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b58af766f21223759caf2ede5675d7cda0c345f13d24435f1f9a4bd1cefb33fc", "ja": "マイガーッ！　このビーチ、サメがいるの！？\nは、早くみんなに知らせなきゃ！", "zh": "天啊——！这片海滩上有鲨鱼吗！？\n得、得赶紧告诉大家才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_111_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_111_fc_01_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "caf9b893e8ea955aff0e25b62c82922f2fb8dd4179da9f5f90b459f4c9051c96", "ja": "あはは～！　環、違うよ～。\nさっきのはサメじゃなくてイルカでしょっ！", "zh": "啊哈哈～！小环，不对啦～刚才那个不是鲨鱼，是海豚吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_111_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_111_fc_01_1017_040tam", "source_sha256": "84cf77add21c1e53c415c946e5bcef736a90080277cb32238d5d4e5594846f2a", "ja": "あ、そっか！　イルカだった！\nきゅるきゅる鳴いて、すっごく可愛かったんだ～！", "zh": "啊，原来是这样！是海豚！\n它发出啾啾的叫声，特别可爱～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_111_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_111_fc_01_1018_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0bfa09f4d44ae3baea181f19da9e9c62df9005c16d0a8e7e0be7bb3a3f371085", "ja": "な、なんだ、イルカだったのか。\n……って、それはそれですごくない？", "zh": "原、原来是海豚啊。\n……等等，那也很厉害吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_111_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_111_fc_01_1019_029umi", "source_sha256": "e568f8fbbaba0f2fe77cd72955ebdfd9af0da1fb5d442d8b0331e1cebb0a7b93", "ja": "すごいよね！　それに、他にもいっぱいお魚がいて！\n見つけてすぐ、環と一緒に全力で追いかけちゃった☆", "zh": "很厉害吧！而且还有好多好多其他的鱼呢！\n刚发现的时候，我就和小环一起全力追了上去☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_111_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_111_fc_01_1020_036kan", "source_sha256": "ae324aebe25e54765f35e2facd0c408736d34fbc89c664d34b0373915a999c62", "ja": "いいな～、私も一緒に行けばよかった。　\nお魚すいすい～、スイミング～♪", "zh": "真好啊～我也一起去就好了。\n鱼儿游啊游～游泳～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_111_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_111_fc_01_1021_040tam", "source_sha256": "dbf01597044006ee6a9337fc6bb8eff1fb842d28b8b41f2f8f63f540108940f4", "ja": "でも、みんなもう遠くに行っちゃったんだ～。\nもっと一緒に泳ぎたかったな～……。", "zh": "可是，大家都已经游到很远的地方去了～  \n我还想和大家一起多游一会儿呢～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_111_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_111_fc_01_1022_042miy", "source_sha256": "02e89629fe7fe9f2bc6b28aa467f2cc0da2d6d1f5246e8a82642ef780c4385ce", "ja": "きっと大丈夫ですよ～、環ちゃん。\n明日は撮影で、また海に入りますから～。", "zh": "一定没问题的～环！\n明天要拍摄，还会再次下海哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_111_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_111_fc_01_1023_040tam", "source_sha256": "25a793e8528031d09860081fba10b36fe4269155b62ad6fe1cfdcff44e5a1d92", "ja": "ほんとうっ！？　わーい！！\nうみみ、明日もまた一緒に遊べるって！", "zh": "真的！？太棒啦！！\n海美说，明天也能一起玩了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_111_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_111_fc_01_1024_029umi", "source_sha256": "6de471860407088f71372a71d3c086efaf08afb6b877e735d078c7bf2bfc71cf", "ja": "うん、やったね☆\nじゃあ～、明日は一緒に潜りっこしようね！", "zh": "嗯，太好了☆\n那明天一起玩潜水吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_111_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_111_fc_01_1025_008tak", "source_sha256": "c7470e196efe65affcb7358d027330d2e6ac726bc3235e910bef2a84ba8a628a", "ja": "ふふっ、仲睦まじい事です。\nふたりは真の姉妹のようですね。", "zh": "呵呵，关系真是亲密。\n你们两个就像真正的姐妹一样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_111_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_111_fc_01_1026_034ayu", "source_sha256": "de911416665ca97ab76a9c1d25b2e7156006fc6fef53d29c243cfecaa4d5b341", "ja": "あはは、衣装もお揃いだしね～。\nあ、アタシ達もだけど！", "zh": "啊哈哈，而且服装也是成套的呢～。\n啊，虽然我们也是啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_111_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_111_fc_01_1027_036kan", "source_sha256": "35352004afd82e70258cfdd258b2a058477ad9bf51f393391738bbbefa4c9a16", "ja": "どうですか、{$P$}さん？\n私たちの衣装、似合ってますか？？", "zh": "怎么样，{$P$}先生？\n我们的服装，合适吗？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_111_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_111_fc_01_1028_p", "source_sha256": "2733324ed73c84ce2b0b93b41b508d62c14917d193b87b16e19df14302293cb4", "ja": "もちろん。衣装も最高だし、ロケーションも最高だし、\nみんな自身が最高に魅力的だぞ！", "zh": "当然了。服装很棒，选景也很棒，\n而且大家本身也最有魅力了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_111_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_111_fc_01_1029_029umi", "source_sha256": "b8c63e7536d0d3bdaed1d118f34d8fbc6b33f3073ed818912937adb0a02f1b33", "ja": "ほんとっ！？　えへへ、嬉しいな～！\n一緒に女子力の研究して良かったね、環！", "zh": "真的！？嘿嘿，好开心啊～！\n一起研究女子力真是太好了呢，环！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_111_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_111_fc_01_1030_040tam", "source_sha256": "fc7a14cbffa4007d9790eee9961b5b5140989854145426489cb3e5f6253676a2", "ja": "うんっ！　たまきの女子力もすごいんだぞ～！\nくふふ♪", "zh": "嗯！环的女生力也很厉害哦～！\n嘿嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_111_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_111_fc_01_1031_p", "source_sha256": "c7566ee25641c6c858ebb3b70d27f91433564c43004832f4b246221b4433a512", "ja": "頼もしいな！　それじゃ、明日はみんなで\nその魅力を全力で発揮して……。", "zh": "真让人放心！那明天大家就全力展现那份魅力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
